Scoped lut, lutrgb and lutyuv expression lookup tables

The option table (c0..c3, y, u, v, r, g, b, a), the pixel-format lists, the
per-component table construction with its variables and ranges, the (int)
conversion and final clip, and the planar and packed 8-bit application in
src/video-lut.ts and src/video-ops/lut.ts, lutrgb.ts and lutyuv.ts follow
libavfilter/vf_lut.c (options, query_formats, config_props, lut_planar_8bits,
lut_packed_8bits, filter_frame, lutyuv_init, lutrgb_init), with the
ff_fill_rgba_map component order of libavfilter/drawutils.c and the
shorthand rule of process_options in libavfilter/avfilter.c.
Fixed FFmpeg commit:946fcce07b6dcd0331c8cc609192aeff5e1924f8
